      "side": 1,
      "message": "\"aspects can create rules\" -\u003e Assuming by rules you mean Bazel actions, yep, they can register more actions over a bottom-up visitation. Other targets can then depend on the outputs of these registered actions.\n\nhttps://docs.bazel.build/versions/master/skylark/aspects.html#aspect-implementation\n\nLooking at the related VNDK refactoring, I think this is semantically close to what a VNDK/LLNDK aggregating aspect would do, so it shouldn\u0027t make the transition any more difficult.",
